# Exception: the gate pre-registration. A commitment device only works if it is
# committed and timestamped before the data exists, so this one is tracked.
!docs/usefulness-gate.md

# Interview transcripts: default-deny. Real transcripts are sensitive and must
# never be tracked. Only synthetic fixtures are allow-listed.
transcripts/**
!transcripts/README.md
!transcripts/fixtures/
!transcripts/fixtures/**
